  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "We can also mutate Pandas dataframes into new data with operations like sorting:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 116,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "b2 = b.sort_values(\"Year Constructed\")"
   ]
