  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "We can build up Pandas commands to get new sorts of aggregated data:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 118,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "text/plain": [
       "Year Acquired\n",
       "1753.0      1200.0\n",
       "1802.0      4440.0\n",
       "1810.0      4033.0\n",
       "1832.0    120000.0\n",
       "1837.0     10302.0\n",
       "            ...   \n",
       "2015.0    305093.0\n",
       "2016.0    304839.0\n",
       "2017.0      6720.0\n",
       "2018.0     17160.0\n",
       "2019.0      1520.0\n",
       "Name: Square Footage, Length: 171, dtype: float64"
      ]
     },
     "execution_count": 118,
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "execute_result"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "b.groupby(\"Year Acquired\")[\"Square Footage\"].sum()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "We can then use that to make different plots:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 119,
   "metadata": {},
